* Mutant: a 60 kohm resistor in series with each output. With the bench's 50 fF load the outputs settle
* with a 3 ns time constant, so they reach a valid level about 5 ns after the clock edge: every code is
* still read correctly at 19 ns, but the outputs are not valid 3 ns after the edge.
* Expected: fails only output_timing.

.subckt fa_inv a y vdd vss
MP y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MN y a vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
.ends fa_inv
.subckt fa_clkbuf a y vdd vss
* small input stage (the only load on the clk pin), then a driver for the comparator bank
MP1 m a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u
MN1 m a vss vss nfet_03v3 w=1.5u l=0.28u
MP2 y m vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=4
MN2 y m vss vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
.ends fa_clkbuf
.subckt fa_nand2 a b y vdd vss
MP1 y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MP2 y b vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MN1 y a nx vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MN2 nx b vss vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
.ends fa_nand2
.subckt fa_nand4 a b c d y vdd vss
MP1 y a vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MP2 y b vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MP3 y c vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MP4 y d vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MN1 y a n1 vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MN2 n1 b n2 vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MN3 n2 c n3 vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MN4 n3 d vss vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
.ends fa_nand4
.subckt fa_comp clk vinp vinn outp outn vdd vss
* StrongARM latch: outp/outn precharge high, outn falls when vinp > vinn
MTAIL tail clk vss vss nfet_03v3 w=3u l=0.28u m=4
MIN1 dx vinp tail vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MIN2 dy vinn tail vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MNL1 outn outp dx vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MNL2 outp outn dy vss nfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MPL1 outn outp vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MPL2 outp outn vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u
MPC1 outn clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MPC2 outp clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MPC3 dx clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MPC4 dy clk vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
.ends fa_comp
.subckt fa_nor2 a b y vdd vss
MP1 y a px vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MP2 px b vdd vdd pfet_03v3 w=4u l=0.28u m=2
MN1 y a vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
MN2 y b vss vss nfet_03v3 w=2u l=0.28u
.ends fa_nor2
.subckt fa_hold outp outn q vdd vss
* Both comparator outputs go through equal inverters, so the comparator sees the same load whatever the latch
* holds. NOR SR latch: holds while both inverter outputs are low (comparator precharge); q = 1 when outn fell.
XIS outn s vdd vss fa_inv
XIR outp r vdd vss fa_inv
XG1 r qb q vdd vss fa_nor2
XG2 s q qb vdd vss fa_nor2
.ends fa_hold
.subckt flash_adc_3bit vss vdd vrefn vrefp clk vin b2 b1 b0
XCK clk ck vdd vss fa_clkbuf
RL1 t1 vrefn 500
RL2 t2 t1 500
RL3 t3 t2 500
RL4 t4 t3 500
RL5 t5 t4 500
RL6 t6 t5 500
RL7 t7 t6 500
RL8 vrefp t7 500
CT1 t1 vss 2p
CT2 t2 vss 2p
CT3 t3 vss 2p
CT4 t4 vss 2p
CT5 t5 vss 2p
CT6 t6 vss 2p
CT7 t7 vss 2p
XC1 ck vin t1 cp1 cn1 vdd vss fa_comp
XH1 cp1 cn1 q1 vdd vss fa_hold
XC2 ck vin t2 cp2 cn2 vdd vss fa_comp
XH2 cp2 cn2 q2 vdd vss fa_hold
XC3 ck vin t3 cp3 cn3 vdd vss fa_comp
XH3 cp3 cn3 q3 vdd vss fa_hold
XC4 ck vin t4 cp4 cn4 vdd vss fa_comp
XH4 cp4 cn4 q4 vdd vss fa_hold
XC5 ck vin t5 cp5 cn5 vdd vss fa_comp
XH5 cp5 cn5 q5 vdd vss fa_hold
XC6 ck vin t6 cp6 cn6 vdd vss fa_comp
XH6 cp6 cn6 q6 vdd vss fa_hold
XC7 ck vin t7 cp7 cn7 vdd vss fa_comp
XH7 cp7 cn7 q7 vdd vss fa_hold
* thermometer to binary: b2 = q4; b1 = q2.!q4 + q6; b0 = q1.!q2 + q3.!q4 + q5.!q6 + q7
XE1 q2 n2 vdd vss fa_inv
XE2 q4 n4 vdd vss fa_inv
XE3 q6 n6 vdd vss fa_inv
XE4 q7 n7 vdd vss fa_inv
XE5 q2 n4 x1 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE6 n6 x1 b1i vdd vss fa_nand2
XE7 q5 n6 y1 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE8 q3 n4 y2 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE9 q1 n2 y3 vdd vss fa_nand2
XE10 n7 y1 y2 y3 b0i vdd vss fa_nand4
XE11 n4 b2i vdd vss fa_inv
RO2 b2i b2 60k
RO1 b1i b1 60k
RO0 b0i b0 60k
.ends flash_adc_3bit
